<p>On Android you lose most of what makes them special, and they only support the AAC and SBC codecs. Android users get more from the <a href="/products/samsung-galaxy-buds4-pro">Galaxy Buds 4 Pro</a> or the <a href="/products/sony-wf-1000xm6">Sony WF-1000XM6</a>.</p>
<h2>Verdict</h2>
<p>If you own an iPhone, buy these. If you don't, look elsewhere.</p>
